   {b:'Bind the substrate',l:'E + S: enzyme and substrate',c:'The substrate (S) and the enzyme (E) are separate. The substrate fits the enzyme’s active site like a key in a lock.'},
   {b:'Run the reaction',l:'ES: enzyme–substrate complex',c:'The substrate binds to the active site and forms the enzyme–substrate complex (ES).'},
